      "material": "stainless_steel",
      "category": "speeds_feeds",
      "tip_text": "Maintain minimum 0.003 in/tooth feed to prevent work hardening",
      "detail": "Austenitic stainless (304, 316) work hardens rapidly when rubbed. Always maintain positive chip load. Never dwell in cut.",
